SUMMARY:When I Go Away: Remembering Jo-El Sonnier
LOCATION:Acadiana Center for the Arts\, 101 W Vermilion St\, Lafayette
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the enduring legacy of Jo-El Sonnier\, one of Louisia
 na’s most beloved musical ambassadors. With his unmistakable accordion s
 ound\, soulful voice\, and signature blend of Cajun tradition and country 
 roots\, Sonnier carried the spirit of Acadiana to audiences around the wor
 ld. This special concert honors his extraordinary musical journey and cele
 brates the release of his posthumous album\, When I Go Away. A fitting tri
 bute to a Louisiana legend whose music transcends generations and whose le
 gacy will forever be woven into the fabric of South Louisiana. Presented b
 y\n\nhttps://acadianacenterforthearts.org/events/when-i-go-away-rememberin
 g-jo-el-sonnier/?occurrence=2027-01-21
